+
+/*
+ * References:
+ * (1) http://www.multimedia.cx/nsv-format.txt
+ * seems someone came to the same conclusions as me, and updated it:
+ * (2) http://www.stud.ktu.lt/~vitslav/nsv/nsv-format.txt
